===Etymology===
From German ''frankfurter'', the adjectival form of ''[[Frankfurt]]''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{italbrac|Not Australia}} A moist [[sausage]] of soft, even texture and flavor, often made from mechanically recovered meat or meat slurry.

